<section id="status">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <span class="fig-tag">Figure 3 · Status over time</span>
    <h2>The states a person moves through</h2>
    <p>Invited means the person is on the scrubbed list and has a link. Registered means the record is saved. Active starts Dec 1. The giving year ends before the membership year begins, so those states are kept apart.</p>
  </div>
  <figure>
    <div class="panel f3">
<svg viewBox="0 0 1190 300" role="img" aria-label="Status lifecycle: not a member becomes invited when on the scrubbed list, registered when the form is submitted, and active on Dec 1. An invited person whose link expires returns to not a member. A registered individual can upgrade to household. Active members who miss the threshold lapse, which is a later phase.">
  <defs>
    <marker id="a3" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" class="mk"/></marker>
